  "metin": "We are truly grateful to Evşen for all her help and support throughout our property purchases in Istanbul. Buying property in a foreign country can be challenging, but Evşen made the entire experience much easier and more reassuring for our family. She has been incredibly professional, patient, responsive, and always willing to go the extra mile to help us. What impressed us most was her genuine kindness and dedication. She treated us not just as clients, but as friends, and we always felt that she truly cared about our interests. We couldn’t have asked for a better real estate agent. We highly recommend Evşen to anyone looking to purchase property in Istanbul. Thank you, Evşen! We are so happy to have met you, and we look forward to seeing you again in Istanbul! ❤️",
